{"created": "2026-09-22T20:23:29.399110+00:00", "modified": "2026-09-22T20:23:32.628144+00:00", "id": 22852474, "conceptrecid": "22852473", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.22852474", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.22852473", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22852474", "metadata": {"title": "Bihar panchayat election 2016: archived results-form pages and a validated release", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.22852474", "publication_date": "2026-09-20", "description": "<p>Every page the Bihar State Election Commission's archived 2016 panchayat results form returned, and the validated tables built from them. The form at <code>sec.bihar.gov.in/old-sec/ovc.aspx</code> serves one page per seat behind cascading dropdowns; this deposit holds all 258,742 saved responses covering 258,071 seats across the six offices - ward member, panch, mukhiya, sarpanch, panchayat samiti member and zila parishad member - collected in September 2026, together with the seat frame, the seat-reservation roster PDFs published beside the form, and three tables: 258,095 seats, 644,865 candidate rows and 210,717 winners.</p><p>Every candidate row names the page it was read from and that page's SHA-256, so the tables can be rebuilt from the archived pages with no network access. The form states no winner, so winners are derived and the basis is recorded; 402 seats name none. 39,003 seats answer \"Record not Found\" and are kept and flagged rather than dropped. See README_DATA.md for the audit against independent sources and the known limits.</p><p>Collected and built with <a href=\"https://github.com/in-rolls/local_elections_bihar\">in-rolls/local_elections_bihar</a>.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Sood, Gaurav", "affiliation": null}], "keywords": ["India", "Bihar", "panchayat", "local elections", "reservation", "seat reservation", "2016", "State Election Commission"], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "https://github.com/in-rolls/local_elections_bihar", "relation": "isSupplementTo",